{"path":"/b2b-website-redesign/","slug":"b2b-website-redesign","kind":"landing","title":"B2B Website Redesign Agency | Legency Media","description":"A B2B website redesign that keeps the rankings you already earned: every URL mapped to a 301, schema carried over, and a before-and-after your board can read as arithmetic.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Services</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>B2B Website Redesign</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Rebuild the site without losing what already ranks. Every URL is mapped before anything moves, schema carries across, and the same measurements are taken before and after, so the traffic you spent years earning arrives at the new site and the result reads as arithmetic.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Redesigned Safely</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where a B2B Website Redesign Loses Traffic</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z\"/><path d=\"M8 10L16 10\"/><path d=\"M8 18L16 18\"/><path d=\"M8 14L12 14\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Old URLs stop resolving and rankings die</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The page structure changes and the old addresses stop resolving. Pages that took years to earn their rankings return errors, and the traffic they carried does not find its way back on its own.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Structured data treated as a launch-week detail</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Structured data and search snippets get treated as a launch-week detail. On day one an engine loses the machine-readable version of a site it already understood.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Nothing was measured before the rebuild</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The old site was only ever judged on taste, so the new one gets judged the same way. Six months later nobody can say what the redesign earned.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Earned traffic arrives at the new site on day one</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A crawl of the live site produces the full 301 map before launch, so each old address arrives at the page that replaces it and the rankings travel with it.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M3 17.4V6.6C3 6.26863 3.26863 6 3.6 6H16.6789C16.8795 6 17.0668 6.10026 17.1781 6.26718L20.7781 11.6672C20.9125 11.8687 20.9125 12.1313 20.7781 12.3328L17.1781 17.7328C17.0668 17.8997 16.8795 18 16.6789 18H3.6C3.26863 18 3 17.7314 3 17.4Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Engines still understand the site at launch</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Structured data and search snippets are rebuilt on the new templates before launch, and the pages that never had them get them for the first time, so nothing is lost on day one.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The result goes to the board as arithmetic</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Rankings, conversion and a 100-point readability score are recorded on the old site and re-run identically on the new one, so what the redesign earned is a comparison rather than an opinion.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>What Carries Over</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Four Things You Keep Through the Redesign</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The Rankings You Earned</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Every live URL mapped to its new home before launch. On one six-site estate, 261 URLs stranded on a retired domain were mapped to the brands that should own them.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Site Engines Can Still Read</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Markup rebuilt on the new templates and re-checked after launch. Across that same estate, 230 markup errors were closed and technical health rose on all five sites measured in month one, by 5 to 10 points each.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Proof the Redesign Worked</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A 100-point readability audit is run before the rebuild and re-run identically after it. One client moved from 30 to 59 in two months on that scale, our own audit both times.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>No Rebuild in Two Years</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The new site ships as a governed component library, so the round of change after this one is your marketing team adding pages instead of another rebuild.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>Before You Commit</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>Most Redesigns Solve a Problem Nobody Diagnosed</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>A redesign is the most expensive answer available, and it is usually chosen before anyone has established what is actually wrong. These are the four reasons we hear, and what each one really needs.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><h3 data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>\"It looks dated\"</h3><p data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>Sometimes true and rarely the reason revenue is flat. Worth checking what the site does on mobile, how fast it is, and whether the copy still describes what you sell, before spending on a new look for the same problems.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><h3 data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>\"We have repositioned\"</h3><p data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>The strongest reason on this list. When what you sell has genuinely changed, the structure has to change with it, and patching the old structure produces a site that argues with itself.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><h3 data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>\"Nobody converts\"</h3><p data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>This is a conversion problem and a redesign is the slowest way to address it. It also destroys the attribution: change everything at once and you can never say which change did the work.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><h3 data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>\"Marketing cannot change anything\"</h3><p data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>A build problem rather than a design one. If the reason for the redesign is that the current site is unmaintainable, say so, because it changes what the new one has to be good at.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>The Real Risk</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>The Traffic You Already Earned Is What You Can Lose</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>A redesign changes URLs, structure and copy at once. Done without care, the site loses rankings it took years to build, and the loss shows up a quarter later when nobody connects it to the launch.</p></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><ol class=\"dp__steps\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>01</span><div data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><h3 data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>Inventory what currently earns</h3><p data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>Every URL with impressions, clicks, backlinks or conversions gets listed before anything is designed. Pages that earn nothing can be cut without ceremony. Pages that earn quietly are the ones a redesign usually deletes by accident.</p></div></li><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>02</span><div data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><h3 data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>Map every old URL to a new one</h3><p data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>A one-to-one redirect map, written before launch rather than after the 404s appear. Redirecting everything to the home page is the usual shortcut and it throws away most of the equity it was meant to preserve.</p></div></li><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>03</span><div data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><h3 data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>Keep the content that ranks</h3><p data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>If a page ranks, its substance moves across even when its design does not. Cutting a thousand words to fit a new template is how a site loses the position that was paying for itself.</p></div></li><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>04</span><div data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3><h3 data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>Watch the first ninety days</h3><p data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>Crawl weekly after launch, compare against the pre-launch baseline, and fix what moved. Most redesign damage is recoverable if it is caught in the first month and expensive once it is not.</p></div></li></ol><p class=\"dp__foot\" data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3>This is also the argument for redesigning in stages where the site allows it: fewer variables changing at once, and a result you can still attribute afterwards.</p></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/k2-group.svg\" alt=\"K2 Group\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Six sites, run as one estate.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>A move off K2 Group’s old domain had left rankings stranded behind it. 261 URLs were mapped to the brands that should own them, and the retired domain fell from 103 ranked terms to 3 as the group’s brand search moved to first place on the live site.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/k2-group/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/covers/case-k2-group.jpg\" alt=\"A harbour at night with moored boats, rendered as a blue pixel dither, captioned Six sites, one answer\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Before You Commit</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out Whether You Need a Redesign at All</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A redesign is the most expensive answer available and it is often not the right one. A call about what is actually underperforming, and whether a smaller piece of work would do it instead.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How we separate what is genuinely wrong from what merely looks dated</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How a rebuild keeps what the current site already earns</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A staged option where the site allows it, so results stay attributable</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/b2b-web-design/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How we approach B2B design</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Will a redesign lose our search rankings?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Not if the URLs are mapped before anything moves. Every live address gets a 301 to the page that replaces it, metadata and schema carry across, and rankings are watched weekly through cutover rather than checked a month afterwards. The traffic you spent years earning arrives at the new site on day one.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How long does a B2B website redesign take?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It depends on how many pages, templates and integrations are involved. Every redesign starts with an audit that scopes the work and sets a timeline before anything gets designed, so a launch tied to a funding round, a product release or a campaign date is planned against a real schedule rather than a hope.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you prove the redesign worked?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>The same measurements get taken twice. Rankings, conversion on the pages that matter and a 100-point readability score are recorded on the old site and re-run identically on the new one, so the before and after compare directly.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What happens to content published in other languages?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It carries across with everything else and then gets extended. On one six-site estate we wrote and attached 205 new answers, 75 of them running in French, Spanish, Portuguese and Mandarin, with regulatory content held in English deliberately because a drifting translation carries real risk.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What stops us needing another redesign in two years?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>The site ships as a component library your marketing team owns. New pages, sections and campaigns come out of parts that already exist, so the next round of change is an extension rather than another rebuild, and the rebuild budget stays in the pipeline.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".dp__grid[data-astro-cid-tkfrg6e3]{gap: